    {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186105908,
        "id": "26c84e5b-97a7-5116-a90c-e4f011e87cf0",
        "title": "Determining Whether Three Vectors are Coplanar"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "64da9d02-a3b8-5f13-a136-0a2e2b8c750b",
        ":question/problem": "Find $k$ given that the vectors $a=\u27e8k,-3,4\u27e9$, $b=\u27e85,6,-7\u27e9$, and $c=\u27e8-2,8,3\u27e9$ are coplanar.\n\n$k=${{field-1}}",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "4c04bf08-7cfa-5d06-8b64-c1d7044aad71",
            ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
            ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/blank",
            ":answer-field/choices": [
              {
                ":answer/id": "cf3b04ac-9003-5ee6-93c6-f99e464424d6",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "-\\frac{211}{74}"
              }
            ],
            ":answer-field/correct": [
              ":answer/id",
              "cf3b04ac-9003-5ee6-93c6-f99e464424d6"
            ]
          }
        ],
        ":question/worked-solution": "Computing the triple product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot(b\\times c)&=|\\begin{aligned}k & -3 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 6 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|\\\\ &=((k)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & -7 \\\\ 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|)+((3)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}|)+((4)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 8\\end{aligned}|)\\\\ &=((k)\\cdot ((6)\\cdot (3)-(-7)\\cdot (8)))+((3)\\cdot ((5)\\cdot (3)-(-7)\\cdot (-2)))+((4)\\cdot ((5)\\cdot (8)-(6)\\cdot (-2)))\\\\ &=((k)\\cdot (74))+((3)\\cdot (1))+((4)\\cdot (52))\\\\ &=(74k)+(3)+(208)\\\\ &=74k+211\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThree vectors are coplanar if and only if their triple product is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}74k+211&=0\\\\ 74k&=-211\\\\ k&=-\\frac{211}{74}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the three vectors are coplanar if and only if $k=-\\frac{211}{74}.$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
      },
